Z||000000||Cooter||04-12-2000||09:42 PM||||After going into sticker shock at the price of Crane's roller rockers for the 60 degree V6, I went to the Pontiac dealership and pulled out the Performance Parts book:<BR>Roller Rocker #24504436 @$13.90 each= $166.80<BR>Roller Cam #14031378 @$208.10<BR>Roller Lifters #?????? @$14.00 each= $168.00<P>These are list prices and could be bought cheaper with the "shop discount".<P>The guy with the 60 degree V6 Performance website has the wrong part number for the roller rockers- the number he has is a discontinued part.||||reg||1
Z||000001||batboy||04-12-2000||09:58 PM||||I hear you about the roller cam stuff, but they are worth it, lots of power gains to be had with them. I'm assuming the 3.4 is machined for factory roller lifters, right? If so, then go for it, assuming the wife don't find out the true price...||||reg||1
Z||000002||Eric||04-12-2000||11:30 PM||||The chevy roller crockers are actually roller tiped rockers I think they're made by comp cams (in Jegs catalog for $150ish) they aren't going to do much unless you get the 1.6 ratio which may not work with the cam.  Speaking of the cam, that's one expensive ham.  They state a "list" price in their catalog but they should give you everything for like 10% less.  Atleast that's what they did for me.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Cooter||04-13-2000||12:07 AM||||I checked the price with my discount and the cam is $156.08, and the rockers are $125.16. I forgot to ask about the lifters. <BR>I did not know that the rockers were just roller tip. I think that I will pass on them. Oh well, too cheap to be too good I guess.||||reg||1
Z||000004||terryk||04-13-2000||01:05 AM||||My Crane roller rockers were $260 for the set in 1989. Did they discontinue them? I've been trying to find the receipt for the part number.<P>Are any of these the numbers you check on?<P>Crane Hi-Intensity 1.5 Roller Rockers - 11756-12 ~$250<P>Crane Aluminum 1.5 Roller Rockers - 25750-12 ~$250<P>Competition Cams Magnum Roller Tipped Rockers 1.5:1 - 1413-12 ~$150<P>Competition Cams Magnum Roller Tipped Rockers 1.6:1 - 1414-12 ~$150<P><p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 04-13-2000).]||||reg||1
